.env

# iCloud sync duplicates ("filename 2.ext") — never commit these.
# The extension list missed .mjs and .mts, which is what the guide content
# modules use, so ten of them arrived unnoticed. Any digit, not just 2:
# iCloud counts upwards when it makes a copy of a copy.
*[[:space:]][0-9].ts
*[[:space:]][0-9].tsx
*[[:space:]][0-9].mjs
*[[:space:]][0-9].mts
*[[:space:]][0-9].json
*[[:space:]][0-9].sql
*[[:space:]][0-9].py
# And files with no extension at all — "Dockerfile 2" slipped past a rule
# that only matched a dot.
Dockerfile[[:space:]][0-9]
*file[[:space:]][0-9]
